9f12)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev (8fade9f12) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (3840x2160 @ 120.00 Hz, 3840x2160 @ 60.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 63.11 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nSometimes the root `Panel` is listed at the bottom and sometimes at the top (with the order of all node being inverted). I found it to happen for some `Button`s (not all) and many `EditorAudioBus` subnodes.\n\n### Normal order\n<img height=\"230\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d713a1e-9343-45f5-ab98-42c33a79e397\" />\n\n### Inverted order\n<img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/364bb8ed-7598-4593-b52d-9335fbb5f53b\" />\n\n<img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06fd7601-4c1b-459b-9ddc-67e9ab2e7eb4\" />\n\n<img height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d918a09-b845-4c52-9e4a-1471ec4de26b\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Under `Debug` -> `Customize Run Instances...` add `-e` to `Main Run Args:`\n- Run any scene (it will run the editor instead)\n- Select `2D` and the node list tool (if you get a popup click `Reload from disk`)\n- Click on different elements to check the order\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/